# hypernix.smoker

4-tier training quality: UseableSmoker / GoodSmoker / CommercialSmoker / HighQualitySmoker.

## Documentation pages

- [Smoker](../../#/docs/Smoker) · [MDXL source](pages/Smoker.mdxl)

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `Smoker()`

Base smoker. Subclasses override :meth:`smoke`.

### `Smoker.smoke(dataset, out_dir) -> Path`

Subclasses implement.

### `UseableSmoker()`

Minimum viable smoker. Straight pass-through to ``oven.train``.

### `GoodSmoker()`

Swaps vanilla AdamW for :class:`PressureCooker`. The LR

### `CommercialSmoker()`

Adds an exponential moving average of weights and periodic

### `HighQualitySmoker()`

Curriculum: trains in progressive context lengths. Runs three

### `smoker(tier, oven, **kw) -> Smoker`

Pick a smoker tier by short name.

